<view class="page editor-page"><text class="eyebrow">RECAP EDITOR · {{selectedIds.length}} SELECTED</text><text class="display-title">先选择，&#10;想放进故事里的片段</text><view class="title-field"><text class="form-label">回顾标题</text><input class="input" value="{{title}}" maxlength="30" bindinput="titleInput" /></view><view class="safety-note"><text>默认保护已生效</text><text class="label">仅自己可见内容已硬排除；另有 {{excludedCount}} 条敏感片段未进入候选。你可回到原记录单独查看。</text></view><view class="chapter"><view class="chapter-head"><view><text>01</text><text class="label">普通日子</text></view><text>{{candidates.length}} 个候选</text></view><button wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="id" class="candidate {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}} press" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle"><view class="candidate-art tone-{{item.cover.tone || 'paper'}}"><image wx:if="{{item.cover.path}}" src="{{item.cover.path}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><text>{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="candidate-copy"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="label">{{item.body}}</text><text class="small">{{item.mood}} · {{item.events[0]}}</text></view><view class="select-mark">{{item.selected ? '✓' : '＋'}}</view></button></view><button class="primary-button preview-button press" bindtap="preview">预览回顾 · {{selectedIds.length}} 段</button></view>
